>An awful lot of "bane" weapons, all of which are nearly useless.
>sjdevnull mentioned demonbane in particular, but I've always though ALL
>the banes should do at least tripple damage. If Grayswandir can do
>double damage against all monsters, surely a weapons specifically made
>to fight a particular kind could do better.

In my opinion, the Monster Banes are beyond all hope of improvement.
Sure, the Enhanced Artifacts patch tried valiantly to preserve them,
but in my opinion an artifact whose sole ability is limited extra
damage isn't worth keeping.

Burn them! Burn them all! (Except Sunsword. Sunsword is redeemed by the
fact that it sheds light - and not ordinary light, either, but
sunlight, which has an effect on specific monsters. See
http://www.greyfire.org/~l/banes-sunsword.diff. And we might as well
keep Sting too, but maybe not Orcrist.)



